      "message": "Oh, it looks like there is a dependency. Given [this comment](http://b/427468960#comment18), it sounds like there should be a [Kconfig dependency](https://docs.zephyrproject.org/latest/build/kconfig/tips.html#select-statements) that enables `CONFIG_PM_DEVICE_RUNTIME` when [`CONFIG_CROS_NPCX_SHI`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/drivers/cros_shi/Kconfig;l\u003d7-17;drc\u003d30c228c1216cef54e125df3996868247a40d3848) is enabled. Then we don\u0027t need `CONFIG_PM_DEVICE_RUNTIME` here.",
